                        "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"pv-wrap\"><p class=\"kicker\">Contact</p><h1>Send a signal.</h1><p class=\"hero-copy\">This academic static demo validates locally and does not transmit personal information.</p></div></section><section class=\"page-section\"><div class=\"pv-wrap two-col\"><div><h2>Project channel</h2><p>Use the form to test accessible validation and status messaging, or prepare an email using the link below.</p><a class=\"pv-btn\" href=\"mailto:student@example.invalid\">Prepare email</a></div><form class=\"pv-form\" data-static-form><label>Name<input name=\"name\" required autocomplete=\"name\"></label><label>Email<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\"></label><label>Message<textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"6\" required></textarea></label><button class=\"pv-btn\" type=\"submit\">Check message</button><p class=\"pv-status\" role=\"status\"></p></form></div></section>"
